# Start: the systems page, focus on SELECT ALL. End: the CLOUD hub, after the
# transfer page has been closed. Up from the first row is the button bar on
# BACK; right is BACK UP / RESTORE. The wait covers a small fixture; a real
# library needs longer, and the page says PRESS ANY BUTTON TO CLOSE when done.
key up
wait 1
key right
wait 1
key x
wait 4
shot transfer-running
wait 16
shot transfer-done
key x
wait 2
